[{"s":100,"a":6,"en":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","mankind"],["لِرَبِّهِۦ","to his Lord"],["لَكَنُودٞ","(is) surely ungrateful"]]},{"s":51,"a":46,"en":"And [We destroyed] the people of Noah before; indeed, they were a people defiantly disobedient.","w":[["وَقَوۡمَ","And (the) people"],["نُوحٖ","(of) Nuh"],["مِّن","before"],["قَبۡلُۖ","before"],["إِنَّهُمۡ","indeed,they"],["كَانُواْ","were"],["قَوۡمٗا","a people"],["فَٰسِقِينَ","defiantly disobedient"]]},{"s":22,"a":32,"en":"That [is so]. And whoever honors the symbols of Allah - indeed, it is from the piety of hearts.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَۖ","That"],["وَمَن","and whoever"],["يُعَظِّمۡ","honors"],["شَعَـٰٓئِرَ","(the) Symbols"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["فَإِنَّهَا","then indeed,it"],["مِن","(is) from"],["تَقۡوَى","(the) piety"],["ٱلۡقُلُوبِ","(of) the hearts"]]},{"s":39,"a":13,"en":"Say, \"Indeed I fear, if I should disobey my Lord, the punishment of a tremendous Day.\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["إِنِّيٓ","Indeed,I"],["أَخَافُ","[I] fear"],["إِنۡ","if"],["عَصَيۡتُ","I disobey"],["رَبِّي","my Lord"],["عَذَابَ","(the) punishment"],["يَوۡمٍ","(of) a Day"],["عَظِيمٖ","great"]]},{"s":30,"a":12,"en":"And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will be in despair.","w":[["وَيَوۡمَ","And (the) Day"],["تَقُومُ","will (be) established"],["ٱلسَّاعَةُ","the Hour"],["يُبۡلِسُ","will (be in) despair"],["ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُونَ","the criminals"]]},{"s":65,"a":9,"en":"And it tasted the bad consequence of its affair, and the outcome of its affair was loss.","w":[["فَذَاقَتۡ","So it tasted"],["وَبَالَ","(the bad) consequence"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["وَكَانَ","and was"],["عَٰقِبَةُ","(the) end"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["خُسۡرًا","loss"]]},{"s":64,"a":15,"en":"Your wealth and your children are but a trial, and Allah has with Him a great reward.","w":[["إِنَّمَآ","Only"],["أَمۡوَٰلُكُمۡ","your wealth"],["وَأَوۡلَٰدُكُمۡ","and your children"],["فِتۡنَةٞۚ","(are) a trial"],["وَٱللَّهُ","and Allah"],["عِندَهُۥٓ","with Him"],["أَجۡرٌ","(is) a reward"],["عَظِيمٞ","great"]]},{"s":25,"a":11,"en":"But they have denied the Hour, and We have prepared for those who deny the Hour a Blaze.","w":[["بَلۡ","Nay"],["كَذَّبُواْ","they deny"],["بِٱلسَّاعَةِۖ","the Hour"],["وَأَعۡتَدۡنَا","and We have prepared"],["لِمَن","for (those) who"],["كَذَّبَ","deny"],["بِٱلسَّاعَةِ","the Hour"],["سَعِيرًا","a Blazing Fire"]]},{"s":2,"a":242,"en":"Thus does Allah make clear to you His verses that you might use reason.","w":[["كَذَٰلِكَ","Thus"],["يُبَيِّنُ","makes clear"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["لَكُمۡ","for you"],["ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","His Verses"],["لَعَلَّكُمۡ","so that you may"],["تَعۡقِلُونَ","use your intellect"]]},{"s":85,"a":6,"en":"When they were sitting near it","w":[["إِذۡ","When"],["هُمۡ","they"],["عَلَيۡهَا","by it"],["قُعُودٞ","(were) sitting"]]},{"s":78,"a":24,"en":"They will not taste therein [any] coolness or drink","w":[["لَّا","Not"],["يَذُوقُونَ","they will taste"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["بَرۡدٗا","coolness"],["وَلَا","and not"],["شَرَابًا","any drink"]]},{"s":70,"a":42,"en":"So leave them to converse vainly and amuse themselves until they meet their Day which they are promised -","w":[["فَذَرۡهُمۡ","So leave them"],["يَخُوضُواْ","(to) converse vainly"],["وَيَلۡعَبُواْ","and amuse themselves"],["حَتَّىٰ","until"],["يُلَٰقُواْ","they meet"],["يَوۡمَهُمُ","their Day"],["ٱلَّذِي","which"],["يُوعَدُونَ","they are promised"]]},{"s":57,"a":3,"en":"He is the First and the Last, the Ascendant and the Intimate, and He is, of all things, Knowing.","w":[["هُوَ","He"],["ٱلۡأَوَّلُ","(is) the First"],["وَٱلۡأٓخِرُ","and the Last"],["وَٱلظَّـٰهِرُ","and the Apparent"],["وَٱلۡبَاطِنُۖ","and the Unapparent"],["وَهُوَ","and He"],["بِكُلِّ","(is) of every"],["شَيۡءٍ","thing"],["عَلِيمٌ","All-Knower"]]},{"s":111,"a":1,"en":"May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","w":[["تَبَّتۡ","Perish"],["يَدَآ","(the) hands"],["أَبِي","(of) Abu"],["لَهَبٖ","Lahab"],["وَتَبَّ","and perish he"]]},{"s":34,"a":49,"en":"Say, \"The truth has come, and falsehood can neither begin [anything] nor repeat [it].\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["جَآءَ","Has come"],["ٱلۡحَقُّ","the truth"],["وَمَا","and not"],["يُبۡدِئُ","(can) originate"],["ٱلۡبَٰطِلُ","the falsehood"],["وَمَا","and not"],["يُعِيدُ","repeat"]]},{"s":96,"a":2,"en":"Created man from a clinging substance.","w":[["خَلَقَ","He created"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","man"],["مِنۡ","from"],["عَلَقٍ","a clinging substance"]]},{"s":91,"a":13,"en":"And the messenger of Allah [Salih] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allah or [prevent her from] her drink.\"","w":[["فَقَالَ","But said"],["لَهُمۡ","to them"],["رَسُولُ","(the) Messenger"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["نَاقَةَ","(It is the) she-camel"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["وَسُقۡيَٰهَا","and her drink"]]},{"s":12,"a":91,"en":"They said, \"By Allah, certainly has Allah preferred you over us, and indeed, we have been sinners.\"","w":[["قَالُواْ","They said"],["تَٱللَّهِ","By Allah"],["لَقَدۡ","certainly"],["ءَاثَرَكَ","Allah has preferred you"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah has preferred you"],["عَلَيۡنَا","over us"],["وَإِن","and indeed"],["كُنَّا","we have been"],["لَخَٰطِـِٔينَ","sinners"]]},{"s":15,"a":84,"en":"So nothing availed them [from] what they used to earn.","w":[["فَمَآ","And not"],["أَغۡنَىٰ","availed"],["عَنۡهُم","them"],["مَّا","what"],["كَانُواْ","they used (to)"],["يَكۡسِبُونَ","earn"]]},{"s":69,"a":35,"en":"So there is not for him here this Day any devoted friend","w":[["فَلَيۡسَ","So not"],["لَهُ","for him"],["ٱلۡيَوۡمَ","today"],["هَٰهُنَا","here"],["حَمِيمٞ","any devoted friend"]]},{"s":68,"a":33,"en":"Such is the punishment [of this world]. And the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew.","w":[["كَذَٰلِكَ","Such"],["ٱلۡعَذَابُۖ","(is) the punishment"],["وَلَعَذَابُ","And surely the punishment"],["ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","(of) the Hereafter"],["أَكۡبَرُۚ","(is) greater"],["لَوۡ","if"],["كَانُواْ","they"],["يَعۡلَمُونَ","know"]]},{"s":7,"a":68,"en":"I convey to you the messages of my Lord, and I am to you a trustworthy adviser.","w":[["أُبَلِّغُكُمۡ","I convey to you"],["رِسَٰلَٰتِ","Messages"],["رَبِّي","(of) my Lord"],["وَأَنَا۠","and I am"],["لَكُمۡ","to you"],["نَاصِحٌ","an adviser"],["أَمِينٌ","trustworthy"]]},{"s":98,"a":7,"en":"Indeed, they who have believed and done righteous deeds - those are the best of creatures.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and do"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","those"],["هُمۡ","they"],["خَيۡرُ","(are the) best"],["ٱلۡبَرِيَّةِ","(of) the creatures"]]},{"s":16,"a":98,"en":"So when you recite the Qur'an, [first] seek refuge in Allah from Satan, the expelled [from His mercy].","w":[["فَإِذَا","So when"],["قَرَأۡتَ","you recite"],["ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ","the Quran"],["فَٱسۡتَعِذۡ","seek refuge"],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah"],["مِنَ","from"],["ٱلشَّيۡطَٰنِ","the Shaitaan"],["ٱلرَّجِيمِ","the accursed"]]},{"s":47,"a":7,"en":"O you who have believed, if you support Allah, He will support you and plant firmly your feet.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you who believe"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","O you who believe"],["ءَامَنُوٓاْ","O you who believe"],["إِن","If"],["تَنصُرُواْ","you help"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["يَنصُرۡكُمۡ","He will help you"],["وَيُثَبِّتۡ","and make firm"],["أَقۡدَامَكُمۡ","your feet"]]},{"s":20,"a":111,"en":"And [all] faces will be humbled before the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of existence. And he will have failed who carries injustice.","w":[["۞وَعَنَتِ","And (will be) humbled"],["ٱلۡوُجُوهُ","the faces"],["لِلۡحَيِّ","before the Ever-Living"],["ٱلۡقَيُّومِۖ","the Self-Subsisting"],["وَقَدۡ","And verily"],["خَابَ","will have failed"],["مَنۡ","(he) who"],["حَمَلَ","carried"],["ظُلۡمٗا","wrongdoing"]]},{"s":44,"a":53,"en":"Wearing [garments of] fine silk and brocade, facing each other.","w":[["يَلۡبَسُونَ","Wearing garments"],["مِن","of"],["سُندُسٖ","fine silk"],["وَإِسۡتَبۡرَقٖ","and heavy silk"],["مُّتَقَٰبِلِينَ","facing each other"]]},{"s":77,"a":30,"en":"Proceed to a shadow [of smoke] having three columns","w":[["ٱنطَلِقُوٓاْ","Proceed"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["ظِلّٖ","a shadow"],["ذِي","having"],["ثَلَٰثِ","three"],["شُعَبٖ","columns"]]},{"s":28,"a":52,"en":"Those to whom We gave the Scripture before it - they are believers in it.","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who"],["ءَاتَيۡنَٰهُمُ","We gave them"],["ٱلۡكِتَٰبَ","the Scripture"],["مِن","before it"],["قَبۡلِهِۦ","before it"],["هُم","they"],["بِهِۦ","in it"],["يُؤۡمِنُونَ","believe"]]},{"s":19,"a":79,"en":"No! We will record what he says and extend for him from the punishment extensively.","w":[["كَلَّاۚ","Nay"],["سَنَكۡتُبُ","We will record"],["مَا","what"],["يَقُولُ","he says"],["وَنَمُدُّ","and We will extend"],["لَهُۥ","for him"],["مِنَ","from"],["ٱلۡعَذَابِ","the punishment"],["مَدّٗا","extensively"]]}]